WEBVTT

00:07:28.861 --> 00:07:31.989
necessary to be a fully
functioning adult human.

00:07:32.031 --> 00:07:33.491
(Laughter)

00:07:33.991 --> 00:07:37.203
Either that or I'm as smart as I ever was,

00:07:37.203 --> 00:07:41.874
it’s just now I'm constantly
being subjected to mansplaining.

00:07:41.916 --> 00:07:44.210
(Laughter)

00:07:44.251 --> 00:07:48.631
(Applause)

00:07:48.672 --> 00:07:53.511
So I was in my local Denver bike shop,
and a young summer employee said,

00:07:53.511 --> 00:07:54.762
"Can I help?"

00:07:54.762 --> 00:07:56.514
And I said, "Yeah,

00:07:56.555 --> 00:07:59.892
can the frame of an older
Gary Fisher mountain bike

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:03.604
start to flex and bend enough
that it causes the rear brake to rub?"